# Style reference sets used to be excluded here. That rule was lifted on
# 2026-08-25 after re-reading the source terms: the clause that appeared to ban
# redistribution (Elser ToS 5.2(i)) prohibits "license, sell, ... reproduce,
# distribute, host or otherwise commercially exploit **the Service** or any part
# of it" -- "otherwise" marks the listed verbs as instances of commercial
# exploitation, and the object is the platform, not the Outputs it produces.
# This project's use is academic and non-commercial.
#
# Each set still needs its own PROVENANCE.md recording source, licence reading
# and residual risk before it is committed -- git keeps whatever is pushed
# forever. See 2026q3_owner_curated/PROVENANCE.md for the full determination,
# including the watermark question, which that clause does not settle.

# 測試產出
.pytest_cache/
backend/test-results.xml
.coverage
htmlcov/


# ── PersonaFlow2（Node 互動層）─────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# 活動資料快照。內含重連憑證與主辦端密鑰的明文，不進版本控制。
data/

# 參與者掃描生成的角色貼圖。每場活動重新產生，且內含可辨識個人的影像。
public/assets/gen/*
!public/assets/gen/.gitkeep

# TLS 憑證與私鑰（scripts/make-cert.sh 產生）。私鑰絕不進版控。
certs/


# 3D 背景的參考原型（RoomScene.js 已從中提取所需邏輯，執行期不引用）
background_repo/
